{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "14347b3d50dfa7f95adae550e73334fc59ed996944c94714b2234d51d2a8f9fd", "ja": "{$P$}！　どう、どう？\nアタシのウェイトレス姿、キマってる？", "zh": "{$P$}！怎么样，怎么样？\n我这身女服务员打扮，很帅气吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c2da8b098710c46f6fa9943242c09d854f27563c14e1032397a90de325b52949", "ja": "ああ、いいと思うよ！\nアクティブな感じが、のり子にぴったりだな。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得很不错！\n这种活力十足的感觉，非常适合你，法子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "54a19a6889db197b419470ff36c0853b9731a682efed22120d4ad271c239f965", "ja": "ホ、ホントに？\nアタシ、どっか変なところとか、ない……？", "zh": "真、真的吗？\n我、我有没有什么奇怪的地方……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1003_p", "source_sha256": "32989c415a68f008933f5cd18bcad64a173ec5d926bc25562a4a1b29735337ee", "ja": "うん？　特におかしいところは見当たらないよ。\n気になる事があるのか？", "zh": "嗯？没发现什么特别奇怪的地方哦。\n是有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "436ad80ed881f632e4e7d5639c393fc22f02cec0c3e151679d0061b8ca5f4f09", "ja": "いやー……だってこれ、ウェイトレスじゃん！\nアイドル衣装と、ちょっと違うって言うか……。", "zh": "不是……但这根本就是服务生嘛！\n感觉跟偶像服装有点不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "fe2aa4381cd218d0f399aa40664d4267896862c97e7c86fa264d04c4499924eb", "ja": "ダイナーのウェイトレスって、見られるのも\nお仕事のうち、みたいなところあるでしょ？", "zh": "餐厅的女服务生，被人注视也是工作的一部分，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "4d9dae0a0e2e13c6e4efc408b2075c71906681d70d0727acda5ccd8332956f9f", "ja": "だからさ、{$P$}も、\nダイナーのお客さんになったつもりで見てみてよ！", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}也试着把自己当成餐厅的客人看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1007_p", "source_sha256": "40989dfa7cfe37bde0079671f4fd3d110670f127584117cefd9c06203c0c384b", "ja": "なるほど、そういう事か……わかった。\nじゃあ、お客さんになったつもりで……。", "zh": "原来是这么回事……明白了。那我就把自己当成客人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1008_p", "source_sha256": "11abb6eb69589255938090cbb50a64ca1b0276e60354954935b164f457011ab7", "ja": "じーっ…………。", "zh": "目不转睛地盯着…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "92918625318934518130b91479875a125b09e57a1b4188e0e720269f6e63fc93", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと{$P$}！\n目が真剣すぎ！　お客さんそんなに見ないでしょ！", "zh": "等、等一下，{$P$}！\n你的眼神也太认真了吧！哪有客人会一直盯着看啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1010_p", "source_sha256": "213d1881f55aeefdf39450d5e516b346d9b4c5d51fcddf6146a27d7b4416d974", "ja": "え、いや……見ろって言われたから……。\nじゃあ、どうするんだ？", "zh": "呃，不是……因为你让我看……  \n那要怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "b884b36db4062f3494e190fdde392167d654cef76353c6068159b2f78e9a0ed8", "ja": "えっと……じゃあアタシ、ウェイトレスやってみるよ。\n……いらっしゃいませ！　ご注文は？", "zh": "那个……那我来试试当服务员吧。\n……欢迎光临！您要点些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4c8de96f329691193c5a3bedfb933950be284221553a061eab313a4b57330221", "ja": "ふむ……じゃあこの、バーガーセットひとつ。\n……こういう感じでいいか？", "zh": "嗯……那就来一份汉堡套餐。\n……这样感觉可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "467109a06d57973062bfe945ccbb62609972eb0502cbade236c58ac7aacb5087", "ja": "そうそう。で、どう？　アタシも\nウェイトレスっぽく、自然な印象にできてるかな？", "zh": "对对。怎么样？我也有像女服务生一样，给人一种自然的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "db45a8492f45c6013cdcd21873449ebd13525d1cf00519ee96ab5a6256151f89", "ja": "あ、もうちょっと動いた方がいい？　本場の\nウェイトレスって、ローラースケートとか使うよね？", "zh": "啊，是不是还得再多动一动？正宗的女服务生，不是会用溜冰鞋之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "117f830cb4bc8539846bc17dd64ddc29ccc8e5708b264a1f341ed9cc3b98b873", "ja": "こんな感じで……どうかなっ。", "zh": "像这样……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1016_p", "source_sha256": "95c29d8373510d5dff99c7ff1e2e14e3052cc99ef1498ceee1cd43e12c27aca5", "ja": "いや、そんなに動かなくても……。\n大丈夫、かなり自然な印象だったぞ！", "zh": "不用动得那么厉害……  \n没事，感觉已经很自然了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1017_p", "source_sha256": "df30f3d168257ca89e5ddd037c29d98b15c4818f8f6aa409ba369dafea9af6a8", "ja": "あんまり動くと、せっかくの髪型が乱れちゃうしな。\n似合ってるから、もったいないよ。", "zh": "要是动得太厉害，好不容易弄好的发型可就乱了。\n这发型很适合你，乱了怪可惜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "ee06bfc1ac5b15470975325bcc4797920b4b70956460e6b485f118f3e01d75de", "ja": "えっ、髪のこと、気付いてくれてたの！？\nそれはもっと早く言おうよ！", "zh": "诶，你注意到我的发型了！？\n那你应该早点告诉我呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0294cabb8a08f643b2bc8f9903ee698e86b2db5d2947bad18aab0cf1a6889568", "ja": "あ、ああ。そうだよな。すまない。\n本当によく似合ってると思うよ。", "zh": "啊，嗯。确实是这样。抱歉。\n我真的觉得很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "9e64cd6df2fb4f0798a7e538e7b3758027a8cf60f96a8c80e93d3a5a6947aada", "ja": "あ……ほ、ほらほら、いいから！　注文続けて！\nオーダーは、以上でよろしいですかっ？", "zh": "啊……好、好了好了，别管那么多！继续点单！\n请问订单就这些了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6b1db62cf1e2b702443dad5bd0236545359a6bbece9918822085c18c7bd01cb6", "ja": "あ、ええと……のり子のかわいさを、ステージでも\nしっかり見せていこう、ってのを追加で。", "zh": "啊，呃……再加一项，要在舞台上也好好展现出乃莉子的可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "7cab956e8f58ebae5a641378d31ae342a2c6e1f6a10b0dc1c9ecf6f3fa043938", "ja": "う、うぅ……わかったよ！\nでも、これ以上の追加注文はダメだからね！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……知道啦！\n不过，不能再追加要求了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0244_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "361c25a711399570033c127345659f93b3f8c58c7b3e68e4c604d5aeb5c294ba", "ja": "今日はもう、店じまい！\n明日のご来店をお待ちしていますっ！　うぅ……。", "zh": "今天已经打烊啦！\n欢迎明天再来光顾！呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
